# diff takes A...B; a two-dot range is a usage error and no request is made.
args: diff github.com/x/y@a..b
exit: 2
--- stderr
sego: error: diff takes A...B (Sourcegraph compares from the merge base)
usage: sego diff [--json] REPO@A...B[:PATH] [PATH...]
       sego diff [--json] REPO@REV[:PATH] [PATH...]
